 Game-thread reply diagnostics distinguish channel disconnection from an elapsed receive deadline. Both leave execution unknown; inspect retained operation status/journal before write recovery. A missing reply never proves cancellation or permits blind replay. This source 0.51.4 behavior is not installed or native-qualified; see [reply-diagnostic evidence](plans/decisions/0173-distinguish-game-thread-reply-loss.md).

